q BT 31.18 704.14 Td 0.2 0.2549 0.3333 rg (* Confirm alert and classify severity \(Low / Med / High / Critical\)) Tj ET Q
q BT 31.18 691.38 Td 0.2 0.2549 0.3333 rg (* Collect initial evidence: logs, screenshots, memory capture) Tj ET Q
