BT /F2 8.00 Tf ET
q BT 31.18 617.68 Td 0.2 0.2549 0.3333 rg (* Short-term: isolate affected systems \(network ACL, disconnect\)) Tj ET Q
q BT 31.18 604.92 Td 0.2 0.2549 0.3333 rg (* Long-term: apply hotfix, rotate credentials, block IOCs) Tj ET Q
q BT 31.18 592.17 Td 0.2 0.2549 0.3333 rg (* Preserve forensic evidence before remediation) Tj ET Q
q BT 31.18 579.41 Td 0.2 0.2549 0.3333 rg (* Document all actions with timestamps) Tj ET Q
